comment.narrative:
Air navigation system study is underway. The results of that study will inform the procurement of the systems expected in early 2024.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

ILS feasibility study undertaken by ANSS Jan to Mar 2023; Findings presented to select stakeholders, SLASPA, ECCA, ICAO, DOA and CATCOP June 20 2023; Submission of draft report to WBT on July 12 2023 at CATCOP Technical Meeting. Next steps- Survey with Airlines to confirm equipment used (ILS or GBAS compatible); Complete report with airline information and submit to the WBT and decision on way forward communicated and adopted.

